mmdevapi: the sessions of every program, for the Volume Mixer, and ducking

Every session that plays has a row in a shared section (wine/arctic_audio.h):
SndVol.exe shows it with its program, its level and its meter, and the
volume and mute it sets there are the session's. A program that asked for the
communications endpoint and records, or plays a communications stream, is in
a call; the other programs then duck as the Communications tab says.

